    "description": "The Airline Flight Seatmap Retrieval API provides users with access to detailed seating configurations for various airline flights. Designed for travel companies, booking platforms, and users seeking to optimize their travel experience, this API enables the retrieval of seatmap data associated with specified flights. Consumers can use this resource to display seat availability, facilitate seating preferences, and enhance user experience during the booking process. This API is essential for applications that aim to provide insightful seating information to travelers.",
